By making `candidates` sorted and removing shared state, we guarantee that `generate(board, rack)` returns the **exact same list of moves in the exact same order every single time**. This ensures that the ID `326` calculated during `legal_actions_mask` corresponds to the exact same word when `apply_action` runs 5 milliseconds later.

